    "condition": "\\(\\forall t\\in V(\\mathcal T),\\,\\operatorname{form}(t)\\in\\{\\operatorname{leaf}(B_t=\\varnothing),\\operatorname{introduceVertex}(v;B_t=B_s\\cup\\{v\\}),\\operatorname{introduceEdge}(\\{u,v\\};B_t=B_s),\\operatorname{forgetVertex}(v;B_t=B_s\\setminus\\{v\\}),\\operatorname{join}(s_1,s_2;B_t=B_{s_1}=B_{s_2})\\}\\).",
